OL,3,AShould AI be judging our credit
OL,4,Aworthiness?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGetting approval for a mortgage, a car
OL,7,Floan or even a mobile phone contract
OL,8,Fcan rest on a credit score.
OL,10,FSophie Hope was on the sharp end of
OL,11,Fjust such a decision.
OL,13,F"When I first checked my credit score,
OL,14,Fit was excellent. But then my mortgage
OL,15,Fapplication was suddenly denied by the
OL,16,Flender because of my credit report. It
OL,17,Fwas a massive shock as I'd never had
OL,18,Fbad credit. When I looked into it, my
OL,19,Fscore had gone to 'very poor'," she
OL,20,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
